{"id":2827,"date":"2025-08-12T11:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-08-12T16:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2827"},"modified":"2025-08-12T10:57:13","modified_gmt":"2025-08-12T15:57:13","slug":"visions-nightmares-on-sale-now","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/visions-nightmares-on-sale-now\/","title":{"rendered":"Visions &amp; Nightmares on sale now!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Arkham Horror meets the silver screen this week, with <em>Film Fatale <\/em>coming soon for <em>Arkham Horror: The Card Game<\/em>, while today sees the release of the latest <em>Arkham Horror <\/em>omnibus from Aconyte Books. <em>Visions &amp; Nightmares<\/em> collects three novels by Rosemary Jones \u2013 <em>Mask of Silver<\/em>, <em>The Deadly Grimoire<\/em> and <em>The Bootlegger&#8217;s Dance<\/em> \u2013 that all share some connection to the silver screen in the golden age of movie-making. It&#8217;s a real triple bill of horror, as the cover, by Daniel Strange, perfectly captures.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-IX0Xa wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"simple-height relative w-full flex justify-center items-center px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative mx-auto w-[85%] md:w-[35%]\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/height\/bg_header_height.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/height\/thumbnail_true.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"absolute z-10 thumbnail_news w-[90%]\"\n                     style=\"transform: rotate(1deg); top: 20px; left: 20px;\">\n\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/08\/Visions-NIghtmares-Release_simple-height.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/news\/tape.png\"\n                     alt=\"News image\"\n                     class=\"absolute max-w-[150px] object-cover z-20\"\n                     style=\"transform: rotate(70deg); left: 30%; top: -45px;\"\/>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p>Alongside the three novels, the collection features two brand new short stories starring Betsy Baxter, known for her starring role in <em>The Flapper Detective <\/em>series of movies in the world of Arkham (not to mention her starring role in <em>The Deadly Grimoire<\/em>, and cameo appearances elsewhere in the omnibus). <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-ZBCJxI wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"container simple-width relative max-w-[800px] w-full mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/background_thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center rotate-3\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"absolute w-full z-10 thumbnail_news\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; transform: rotate(1deg);\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/08\/Visions-NIghtmares-Release_simple-width.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p><em>Visions &amp; Nightmares <\/em>is on sale now, in paperback and ebook. You can find a retailer near you <a href=\"https:\/\/books2read.com\/VisionsandNightmares\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;ve already read all three novels, don&#8217;t worry \u2013 the new short stories will be available to read online, here on ArkhamHorror.com. You can read the first \u2013 &#8220;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/web-fiction\/old-terrors\/\">Old Terrors<\/a>&#8221; \u2013\u00a0right now, and we&#8217;ll be bringing you the second story later in the month. Sign up to the <a href=\"https:\/\/newsletter.asmodee.net\/fr\/arkhamhorror\">Arkham Horror newsletter<\/a> to make sure you don&#8217;t miss it.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2836,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":true},"key-tag":[34,33,17,32],"class_list":["post-2827","news","type-news","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","key-tag-aconyte","key-tag-anthologies","key-tag-books","key-tag-novels"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v22.3 (Yoast SEO v22.9) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Visions &amp; Nightmares on sale now! | ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website News<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/visions-nightmares-on-sale-now\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"art